#
# clang-tidy settings for the tests: app/.clang-tidy, with two more checks
# disabled, each with its reason.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access

# Why:
#   cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes
#       Google style allows a test fixture's data members to be protected,
#       and the test harnesses expose what they recorded for the tests to
#       check.
#   bugprone-unchecked-optional-access
#       Tests check an optional with ASSERT_TRUE(x.has_value()), which
#       returns from the test when it fails; the check cannot see that, so
#       it flags every access after it. Source code keeps the check.
